# Subtree-local forbid for clients/test/scripts/.
#
# Replacement semantics: this file fully replaces the root forbid for files
# in this subtree (see scripts/lint-terminology.sh). Keep this in sync with
# the root file when rules change there.
#
# Why this file exists: the test scripts in this directory still build
# pre-round-12 SE events (writePolicy on Icp, governancePolicy on Est-v1,
# SEL prefix derived from policy_said). They will be rewritten to drive the
# round-12 CLI surface in #147. Until then, the est/evl wire-format topic
# strings are exempted here so the production lint stays strict.
# Restore those two patterns when #147 lands.

